  "known_limitations": [
    "CLIP and DINOv2 are general-purpose pretrained encoders, not conservation-specific semantic judges.",
    "Aligned local-token similarity is a representation-space proxy and does not prove object identity, historical correctness, or plausible reconstruction.",
    "CLIP's 7x7 token grid is coarse and is used only as a complementary semantic localization signal.",
    "DINOv2 feature affinity is a diagnostic saliency proxy, not validated eye-tracking, attribution, or causal occlusion sensitivity.",
