    "The painterly representation metric compares DINOv2 patch-feature covariance and does not authenticate style, artist, or brushstrokes.",
    "SDXL evidence remains a predeclared ten-case partial scope and must not be interpreted as full model coverage.",
    "Low semantic drift can coexist with consistently incorrect or historically unsupported restoration."
